3D model of the WH-1000XM5

The model shown for WH-1000XM5 and WH-1000XM6 headphones
(src/assets/models/wh-1000xm5.glb) is "Sony Wh-1000xm5" by Zalaneke
(https://sketchfab.com/Zalanekee), published at
https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/sony-wh-1000xm5-5d8aea0a780b49fa89c9c205912414e3
and licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). It was converted to glTF and
its materials were adjusted for this app. It is not covered by the MIT License
above; the Creative Commons licence applies to it instead.
